 "steps": [
  "Place grape tomatoes in a baking dish and set the block of feta cheese in the center.",
  "Drizzle with olive oil, then season with salt, freshly cracked black pepper, red chili flakes, and dried oregano.",
  "Bake in a preheated oven at 400°F (200°C) for 30 to 35 minutes until tomatoes blister and feta softens.",
  "Pat chicken breast dry with a paper towel, slice horizontally into cutlets, cover with plastic wrap, and pound evenly with a meat mallet.",
  "Season both sides of chicken cutlets with salt and black pepper.",
  "Sear chicken in a pan with a little oil over medium-high heat until golden brown and cooked through, then slice into bite-sized strips.",
  "Remove baking dish from oven, mash tomatoes and feta with a wooden spoon, and stir until a creamy sauce forms.",
  "Toss in cooked pasta, sliced seared chicken, and fresh chopped basil until thoroughly combined."
 ],
